<span data-as="p">Polymarket USD (pUSD) replaces USDC.e as the collateral token. pUSD is a standard ERC-20 on Polygon backed by USDC, with backing enforced onchain by the smart contract. The permissionless Collateral Onramp accepts USDC.e.</span>
<ul>
<li><strong>For users on polymarket.com:</strong> the UI handles wrapping automatically.</li>
<li><strong>For API-only traders:</strong> wrap USDC.e into pUSD via the Collateral Onramp’s <code>wrap()</code> function. See the <a class="link" href="/concepts/pusd">pUSD page</a> for full examples and <a class="link" href="/resources/contracts">Contracts</a> for addresses.</li>
</ul>
