<ul>
<li>All open orders were wiped. Any pre-cutover resting orders must be re-placed with V2 signing.</li>
<li>The SDK’s <strong>hot-swap mechanism</strong> queried a version endpoint and auto-refreshed when V2 went live.</li>
<li>Clients already on the latest V2 SDK did not require manual intervention during the cutover.</li>
</ul>
<span data-as="p"><strong>If your integration is still on the V1 SDK, it will not work against production CLOB V2.</strong> There is no backward compatibility.</span>
<span data-as="p">Follow <a href="https://discord.gg/polymarket" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Discord</a>, Telegram, and <a href="https://status.polymarket.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">status.polymarket.com</a> for operational updates and incident notices.</span>
